------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE
------------------------------------------------------------------------
SATOM manages the following Fortinet application-delivery / analytics
appliances via their public APIs:
  - FortiWeb        (Web Application Firewall)
  - FortiADC        (Application Delivery Controller)
  - FortiAnalyzer   (Log & analytics)
  - FortiAuthenticator (planned)

It is NOT a FortiManager or FortiGate management tool and does not manage
firewalls/next-gen firewalls. Any resemblance of the name to Fortinet
product names is coincidental and unintended.
